            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV rich-text"><div id="content_main_richtext_11" class=" A-PAR16R-RW-ALL-WRAPPER" data-date-format="D/M/YYYY" data-time-format="HH:MM:SS A" data-zone="Hongkong">
    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Step 7:&nbsp;Create your:</p>
<ul class="A-LSTU-RW-ALL">
 <li><strong>Username and password</strong> - you'll need them to set up the HSBC HK App or log on to HSBC Online Banking.</li>
 <li><strong>Security question and answer</strong> - you can use them to help you reset your password in the future if needed. Please select a question and enter an answer you can remember.</li>
</ul>
</div></div>

        
    


        </div>
    
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_25" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-IMG-RW-DEV O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV">
