    <div id="content_main_advanced_expander_2" class="sm-12 clear-float">
        
    <div class="anchor" id="accordion-log-on-with-security-code-on-trusted-browser-i-am-new-to-digital"></div>

        
    
    <div class="A-EXPCNT-RW-RBWM expander">
        <div class="dropdown" aria-controls="280243968__panel0" role="button" tabindex="0">
            <h3 id="280243968__tab0" class="dropdown-text ">I&#39;m new to HSBC Digital Banking (non-HKID holder)&nbsp;</h3>
            <span class="chevron"></span>
        </div>
        <section id="280243968__panel0" class="exp-content " aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">
            <div class="exp-panel">




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="cc-wrapper O-COLCTRL-RW-DEV">
    

<div id="content_main_columnControl_15">
    
    <div class="cc cc-columns-50-50  ">
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_28" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV">

    
    <div class="anchor" id="register-with-your-exit-entry-permit-eep"></div>


<h3 class="heading A-TYP22L-RW-ALL " id="content_main_heading_5">
    Register with your Exit-entry Permit (EEP)
</h3>
</div>

        
    


        </div>
    
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_29" class="cc-column">
            





        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>

        
    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="cc-wrapper O-COLCTRL-RW-DEV">
    

<div id="content_main_columnControl_16">
    
    <div class="cc cc-columns-50-50  ">
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_30" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV rich-text"><div id="content_main_richtext_13" class=" A-PAR16R-RW-ALL-WRAPPER" data-date-format="D/M/YYYY" data-time-format="HH:MM:SS A" data-zone="Hongkong">
    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">You can register for HSBC Online Banking, the HSBC HK App, HSBC HK Easy Invest, and HSBC Reward+ all at once simply with your EEP and a selfie.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Tips:</strong></p>
<ul class="A-LSTU-RW-ALL">
 <li>Get your EEP ready (same EEP as in our record)</li>
 <li>You must be aged 18 or above if you're registering with your EEP</li>
 <li>Complete your registration in a private place with good lighting</li>
</ul>
</div></div>

        
    


        </div>
    
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_31" class="cc-column">
            





        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>

        
    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="cc-wrapper O-COLCTRL-RW-DEV">
    

<div id="content_main_columnControl_17">
    
    <div class="cc cc-columns-50-50  ">
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_32" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV rich-text"><div id="content_main_richtext_14" class=" A-PAR16R-RW-ALL-WRAPPER" data-date-format="D/M/YYYY" data-time-format="HH:MM:SS A" data-zone="Hongkong">
    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Step 1:&nbsp;Download and open the latest version of the <a href="/campaigns/prom189/" target="_self">HSBC HK App</a>. Select 'Log on' and choose 'No, register now'.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Tip:</strong></p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">If you don't have an HSBC account, you can open one through the HSBC HK App and register it for HSBC Digital Banking right away.</p>
</div></div>

        
    


        </div>
    
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_33" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-IMG-RW-DEV O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV">
