<div id="content_main_columnControl_26">
    
    <div class="cc cc-columns-50-50  ">
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_50" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV">

    
    <div class="anchor" id="register-with-your-passport"></div>


<h3 class="heading A-TYP22L-RW-ALL " id="content_main_heading_6">
    Register with your&nbsp;passport
</h3>
</div>

        
    


        </div>
    
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_51" class="cc-column">
            





        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>

        
    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="cc-wrapper O-COLCTRL-RW-DEV">
    

<div id="content_main_columnControl_27">
    
    <div class="cc cc-columns-50-50  ">
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_52" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV rich-text"><div id="content_main_richtext_23" class=" A-PAR16R-RW-ALL-WRAPPER" data-date-format="D/M/YYYY" data-time-format="HH:MM:SS A" data-zone="Hongkong">
    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">If you don't have an HKID, you can still register for the HSBC HK App, HSBC HK Easy Invest, and HSBC Reward+ all at once simply with your supported passport and a selfie.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Tips:</strong><br></p>
<ul class="A-LSTU-RW-ALL">
 <li><strong>Get your passport ready (same passport as in our record).</strong></li>
 <li><strong>Complete your registration in a private place with good lighting.</strong></li>
</ul>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Remarks:</strong><br></p>
<ul class="A-LSTU-RW-ALL">
 <li>Supported passports: Australia, Belgium, Canada, India, Ireland, Italy, Jersey, Mexico, Philippines, Singapore, South Africa, Taiwan, United Kingdom, United States, and Vietnam</li>
 <li>You must be aged 11 or above to verify your identity with your passport</li>
</ul>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Not holding an eligible passport? <a href="/campaigns/prom203/#register-with-your-account-details" target="_self">Find out how to register with your account details</a>.</p>
</div></div>

        
    


        </div>
    
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_53" class="cc-column">
            





        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>

        
    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="cc-wrapper O-COLCTRL-RW-DEV">
    

<div id="content_main_columnControl_28">
    
    <div class="cc cc-columns-50-50  ">
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_54" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV rich-text"><div id="content_main_richtext_24" class=" A-PAR16R-RW-ALL-WRAPPER" data-date-format="D/M/YYYY" data-time-format="HH:MM:SS A" data-zone="Hongkong">
    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Step 1:&nbsp;Download and open the latest version of the <a href="/campaigns/prom189/" target="_self">HSBC HK App</a>. Select 'Log on' and choose 'No, register now'.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Tip:</strong></p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">If you don't have an HSBC account, you can open one through the HSBC HK App and register it for HSBC Digital Banking right away.</p>
</div></div>

        
    


        </div>
    
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_55" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-IMG-RW-DEV O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV">
