    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Step 1: Download and open the latest version of the <a href="/campaigns/prom189/" target="_self">HSBC HK App</a>. Select 'Log on' and choose ‘No, register now'. Next, select 'Continue' and then 'Other methods' to proceed to verify your identity with your account details.</p>
