<div id="content_main_columnControl_43">
    
    <div class="cc cc-columns-50-50  ">
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_84" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV rich-text"><div id="content_main_richtext_38" class=" A-PAR16R-RW-ALL-WRAPPER" data-date-format="D/M/YYYY" data-time-format="HH:MM:SS A" data-zone="Hongkong">
    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">If you're 11 or above and hold a new Smart HKID (2018 version), you can just download and set up the HSBC HK App with your HKID and a selfie.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Tips:</strong></p>
<ul class="A-LSTU-RW-ALL">
 <li><strong>Have your HKID ready (same HKID as in our record)</strong></li>
 <li><strong>Set up the HSBC HK App in a private place with good lighting</strong></li>
</ul>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Note: For security reasons, your Security Device will be disabled once your set up the HSBC HK App.</p>
</div></div>

        
    


        </div>
    
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_85" class="cc-column">
            





        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>

        
    
        
        
            
            
            
            
