            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV rich-text"><div id="content_main_richtext_44" class=" A-PAR16R-RW-ALL-WRAPPER" data-date-format="D/M/YYYY" data-time-format="HH:MM:SS A" data-zone="Hongkong">
    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Step 6:&nbsp;Finally, we'll ask you to create a 6-digit <strong>Mobile Banking PIN</strong> and you may also enable biometric authentication on supported devices for faster and more seamless access.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Tips:</strong></p>
<ul class="A-LSTU-RW-ALL">
 <li>We'll complete your identify verification swiftly and you may log on to the HSBC HK App right away. We may need more time to verify your identity for some cases, but we'll notify you of the result within 24 hours via SMS and email. Upon successful identity verification, you can relaunch the app to log on.</li>
 <li>If you have trouble in setting up the HSBC HK App, visit <a href="/branch-finder/" target="_self">one of our Hong Kong branches</a> for assistance.</li>
</ul>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Note</strong>: After activating the Mobile Security Key, you may need to further <a href="/campaigns/prom203/#verify-your-identity" target="_self">verify your identity</a> before you can enjoy full access to HSBC Online and Mobile Banking services.</p>
</div></div>

        
    


