    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Step 1: Download and open the latest version of the <a href="/campaigns/prom189/" target="_self">HSBC HK App</a>. Select 'Log on' and choose 'Yes, logon'.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Tip:</strong></p>
