            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV">

    <div class="anchor" id="set-up-with-banking-credentials"></div>
    


<h3 class="heading A-TYP22L-RW-ALL " id="content_main_heading_11">
    Set up the HSBC HK App with your passport
</h3>
</div>

        
    


        </div>
    
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_137" class="cc-column">
            





        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>

        
    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="cc-wrapper O-COLCTRL-RW-DEV">
    

<div id="content_main_columnControl_70">
    
    <div class="cc cc-columns-50-50  ">
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_138" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV rich-text"><div id="content_main_richtext_61" class=" A-PAR16R-RW-ALL-WRAPPER" data-date-format="D/M/YYYY" data-time-format="HH:MM:SS A" data-zone="Hongkong">
    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">You just need to download and set up the HSBC HK App simply with your passport and a selfie*.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Tips:</strong></p>
<ul class="A-LSTU-RW-ALL">
 <li><strong>Get your passport ready (same as your bank record)</strong></li>
 <li><strong>Start setting up the HSBC HK App in a private place with good lighting</strong></li>
</ul>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Remarks:</strong></p>
<ul class="A-LSTU-RW-ALL">
 <li>Supported passports:&nbsp;Australia, Belgium, Canada, India, Ireland, Italy, Jersey, Mexico, Philippines, Singapore, South Africa, United Kingdom, United States, Vietnam and Taiwan</li>
 <li>You must be aged 11 or above to verify your identity with your passport</li>
 <li>After setting up the HSBC HK App, your Physical Security Device will be disabled to protect your account.</li>
</ul>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Not holding an eligible passport?&nbsp;<a href="/campaigns/prom203/#credentials">Find out how to set up the HSBC HK App with your online banking credentials</a>.</p>
</div></div>

        
    


        </div>
    
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_139" class="cc-column">
            





        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>

        
    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="cc-wrapper O-COLCTRL-RW-DEV">
    

<div id="content_main_columnControl_71">
    
    <div class="cc cc-columns-50-50  ">
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_140" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV rich-text"><div id="content_main_richtext_62" class=" A-PAR16R-RW-ALL-WRAPPER" data-date-format="D/M/YYYY" data-time-format="HH:MM:SS A" data-zone="Hongkong">
    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Step 1: Download and open the latest version of the <a href="/campaigns/prom189/" target="_self">HSBC HK App</a>. Select 'Log on' and then choose 'Yes, logon'.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Tip:</strong></p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">We'll ask you to create a password if you don't have one.</p>
</div></div>

        
    


        </div>
    
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_141" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-IMG-RW-DEV O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV">
    <div id="content_main_image_175" class="smart-image">
        
            
            <figure class="smart-image-figure">
                
    
    
    <picture id="content_main_image_176">
        
        
        
        <source srcset="/content/dam/hsbc/hk/images/mass/way-to-bank/screenshots/13524-screen-7-en-1600x900.jpg 1x" media="(min-width: 960px)"/>
        <source srcset="/content/dam/hsbc/hk/images/mass/way-to-bank/screenshots/13524-screen-7-en-1600x900.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.web.1220.1000.jpeg 1x" media="(min-width: 480px)"/>
        <source srcset="/content/dam/hsbc/hk/images/mass/way-to-bank/screenshots/13524-screen-7-en-1600x900.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.web.490.1000.jpeg 1x, /content/dam/hsbc/hk/images/mass/way-to-bank/screenshots/13524-screen-7-en-1600x900.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.web.1220.1000.jpeg 2x"/>
        
    <img id="content_main_image_177" class="A-IMAGE-RW-ALL smart-image-img" src="/content/dam/hsbc/hk/images/mass/way-to-bank/screenshots/13524-screen-7-en-1600x900.jpg" alt/>

    </picture>
    


                
            </figure>
        
    </div>
</div>

        
    


