    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Step 6:&nbsp;Finally, we'll ask you to create a 6-digit <strong>Mobile Banking PIN</strong> and you may also enable biometric authentication on supported devices for faster and more seamless access.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Tips:</strong></p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">We'll complete your identify verification swiftly and you may log on to the HSBC HK App right away.&nbsp;</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">In edge cases, we may need more time to verify your identity but we'll notify you of the result within 24 hours via SMS and email. Upon successful identity verification, you can relaunch the app to log on.</span></p>
</div></div>

        
    


