<h3 class="heading A-TYP28L-RW-ALL remove-bottom-space" id="content_main_heading_13">
    Verifying your identity​
</h3>
</div>

        
    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV rich-text"><div id="content_main_richtext_74" class="remove-bottom-space A-PAR16R-RW-ALL-WRAPPER" data-date-format="D/M/YYYY" data-time-format="HH:MM:SS A" data-zone="Hongkong">
    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">To better protect the security of your accounts, you may be asked to verify your identity when required (such as after having activated the Mobile Security Key) to enjoy full access to HSBC Digital Banking services.</p>
</div></div>

        
    


        </div>
    
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_167" class="cc-column">
            





        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>

        
    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="cc-wrapper O-COLCTRL-RW-DEV">
    

<div id="content_main_columnControl_85">
    
    <div class="cc cc-columns-100  ">
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_168" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV O-ADVEXP-RW-RBWM row">
    <div id="content_main_advanced_expander_5" class="sm-12 clear-float">
        
    

        
    
    <div class="A-EXPCNT-RW-RBWM expander">
        <div class="dropdown" aria-controls="-152672557__panel0" role="button" tabindex="0">
            <h3 id="-152672557__tab0" class="dropdown-text ">Verify your identity&nbsp;</h3>
            <span class="chevron"></span>
        </div>
        <section id="-152672557__panel0" class="exp-content " aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">
            <div class="exp-panel">




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="cc-wrapper O-COLCTRL-RW-DEV">
    

<div id="content_main_columnControl_86">
    
    <div class="cc cc-columns-100  ">
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_169" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV rich-text"><div id="content_main_richtext_75" class=" A-PAR16R-RW-ALL-WRAPPER" data-date-format="D/M/YYYY" data-time-format="HH:MM:SS A" data-zone="Hongkong">
    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">To strengthen security measures for protecting our customers, after you've activated the Mobile Security Key via the HSBC HK App on a new device (including removing and reinstalling the HSBC HK App on your existing device), you may need to further verify your identity before you can enjoy full access to HSBC Online and Mobile Banking services.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Your access to the following services on HSBC Online and Mobile Banking may be affected if you do not verify your identity:</p>
<ul class="A-LSTU-RW-ALL">
 <li>Transfers to non-registered third-party accounts</li>
 <li>Bill payments to certain merchants</li>
 <li>Adding new payees for local transfers and HSBC Global Transfers</li>
 <li>Changing transfer limits (including small value and non-registered account transfer limits)</li>
 <li>Viewing your debit card CVV</li>
 <li>Changing personal information</li>
 <li>Mobile cash withdrawal</li>
 <li>Log on to or sign up for PayMe via the HSBC HK App (excluding log on or sign up via mobile number)</li>
</ul>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">The above verification requirement doesn't apply to customers who are setting up the Mobile Banking PIN on an existing device with the Mobile Security Key already activated on the HSBC HK App.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">You can verify your identity using any of these methods:</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong><br> HSBC HK App</strong></p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Just activated your Mobile Security Key on the HSBC HK App on a new device? You can log on to the HSBC HK App and follow the instructions to verify your identity. Alternatively, select the menu icon &gt; the profile icon &gt; 'Security', and follow the steps provided to verify your identity.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong><br> HSBC / Hang Seng ATM</strong></p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">After you've activated your Mobile Security Key via the HSBC HK App, you may use any HSBC / Hang Seng ATM (excluding Foreign Currency ATMs and Express ATMs) in Hong Kong to verify your identity.&nbsp;On the&nbsp;ATM screen, select&nbsp;&nbsp;’Other services‘ &gt; 'Digital banking access' &gt;&nbsp;‘Verify identity for full digital banking access'.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong><br> Call us</strong></p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Alternatively, you may also call our enquiry hotline for assistance:</p>
<ul class="A-LSTU-RW-ALL">
 <li>HSBC Global Private Banking customers:&nbsp;<a href="tel:852-2233-3033">(852) 2233 3033</a></li>
 <li>HSBC Premier Elite customers:&nbsp;<a href="tel:852-2233-3033">(852) 2233 3033</a></li>
 <li>HSBC Premier customers:&nbsp;<a href="tel:852-2233-3322">(852) 2233 3322</a></li>
 <li>Other customers:&nbsp;<a href="tel:852-2233-3000">(852) 2233 3000</a></li>
</ul>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Tip: In the call, please say 'Verify identity for mobile app' when you're asked the purpose of your call. We'll then direct you to the relevant service.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">You may&nbsp;also&nbsp;be required to verify your identity if we detect any suspicious activity on your HSBC HK App, HSBC Online Banking, HSBC Reward+ and HSBC Easy Invest. You'll see a page/ message about it on the HSBC HK App. We'll also notify you via SMS and email.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Follow the instructions seen on the page/ message on the HSBC HK App or&nbsp;in&nbsp;our communications to verify your identity to restore full access to our digital banking services.&nbsp;<a href="/mobile/faq/#verify-your-identity">Learn more</a>.</p>
</div></div>

        
    


        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>

        
    

</div>
        </section>
    </div>

    </div>

</div>

        
    


        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>

        
    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="cc-wrapper O-COLCTRL-RW-DEV">
    

<div id="content_main_columnControl_87">
    
    <div class="cc cc-columns-66-33  ">
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_170" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV">

    <div class="anchor" id="switch-device"></div>
    


<h2 class="heading A-TYP28L-RW-ALL remove-bottom-space" id="content_main_heading_14">
    Switch device
</h2>
</div>

        
    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV rich-text"><div id="content_main_richtext_76" class="remove-bottom-space A-PAR16R-RW-ALL-WRAPPER" data-date-format="D/M/YYYY" data-time-format="HH:MM:SS A" data-zone="Hongkong">
    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">For security reasons, you can only set up the HSBC HK App on one device. If you want to use a new device to log on to the app, please follow below steps to switch your device.&nbsp;</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Please note, after setting up the HSBC HK App, you may need to further <a href="#verify-your-identity">verify your identity</a> before you can enjoy full access to HSBC Online and Mobile Banking services.</p>
</div></div>

        
    


        </div>
    
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_171" class="cc-column">
            





        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>

        
    
        
        
            
            
            
            
