    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Step 1: Download and open the latest version of the <a href="/ways-to-bank/mobile-apps/banking/" target="_self">HSBC HK App</a><span style="font-family: &quot;HSBC Univers Next&quot;, &quot;HSBC Neue Helvetica&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, HSBC_MtUnivers_AED; font-size: 1rem; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);"> on your </span><strong>new device</strong><span style="font-family: &quot;HSBC Univers Next&quot;, &quot;HSBC Neue Helvetica&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, HSBC_MtUnivers_AED; font-size: 1rem; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">. Select 'Log on' and choose 'Yes, logon'.</span></p>
