    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Step 2:&nbsp;Select 'Remove this device' to remove the HSBC HK App from your old device. Next, download the HSBC HK App on your new device, then log on and <a href="/campaigns/prom203/#-1582047031__tab0" target="_self">set up your Mobile Security Key</a>.</p>
