    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Step 2: Reset your 'Mobile Banking PIN' according to the instructions</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Please note, your new Mobile Banking PIN should not include:</p>
<ol class="A-LSTO-RW-ALL">
 <li>the same number more than once in a row, e.g. 000</li>
 <li>more than three ascending or descending digits, e.g. 1234</li>
 <li>repeating patterns, e.g. 010101</li>
 <li>your birthday or any other significant dates (like anniversaries), e.g. 270788.</li>
</ol>
</div></div>

        
    


