    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">Step 4: Generate the security code. Next, enter it per the instructions in HSBC Online or Mobile Banking.</p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Tips:</strong></p>
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">You'll generate an invalid security code if:</p>
<ul class="A-LSTU-RW-ALL">
 <li>You enter the wrong Mobile Banking PIN in the HSBC HK App – you can avoid this by using biometric authentication instead</li>
 <li>The time zone of your mobile device is not set to 'automatic' – you can go to 'Settings' on your device to adjust your time zone settings</li>
 <li>Your Mobile Security Key has been removed from the HSBC HK App.</li>
</ul>
</div></div>

        
    


