<div id="content_main_columnControl_167">
    
    <div class="cc cc-columns-50-50  ">
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_317" class="cc-column">
            




    
        
        
            
            
            
            
            <div class="M-CONTMAST-RW-RBWM O-SMARTSPCGEN-DEV rich-text"><div id="content_main_richtext_143" class=" A-PAR16R-RW-ALL-WRAPPER" data-date-format="D/M/YYYY" data-time-format="HH:MM:SS A" data-zone="Hongkong">
    <p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL"><strong>Tips:</strong><br> </p> 
<p class="A-PAR16R-RW-ALL">You will generate an invalid security code under the following situations:</p> 
<ul class="A-LSTU-RW-ALL"> 
 <li>You have used an incorrect 'Mobile Banking PIN' on HSBC HK App&nbsp;<span style="font-family: &quot;HSBC Univers Next&quot;, &quot;HSBC Neue Helvetica&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 1rem; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;">(You can avoid this by using biometric authentication )</span></li> 
 <li>The time zone of your mobile device is not set to 'automatic'&nbsp;<span style="font-family: &quot;HSBC Univers Next&quot;, &quot;HSBC Neue Helvetica&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 1rem; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent;">(You can go to your phone setting screen to adjust your time zone setting)</span></li> 
 <li>Your Mobile Security Key on HSBC HK App has been removed</li> 
</ul>
</div></div>

        
    


        </div>
    
        
        <div id="content_main_columnControlColumn_318" class="cc-column">
            





        </div>
    </div>
